<title>NORWAY: Nycomed to hold news conference 0730 GMT.</title>
<headline>Nycomed to hold news conference 0730 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norwegian pharmaceuticals company Nycomed ASA said on Tuesday it would hold a news conference at 0730 GMT.</p>
<p>The company declined to comment on an announcement by Britain's Amersham that the two companies had agreed a merger.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
